sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 👤 User (Web / Android)
    participant UI as 🖥️ Next.js + Capacitor UI
    participant API as ⚙️ Spring Boot API
    participant DB as 🐘 PostgreSQL + Redis
    participant AI as 🤖 AI Engine (Gemini 2.5)

    User->>UI: Select Spread (e.g., 3-Card / 5-Card) & Reader Persona
    alt Mode A: Virtual Deck Ritual
        User->>UI: Shuffle, Cut & Tap Cards on Screen
        UI->>UI: Generate SecureRandom + Haptic Feedback
    else Mode B: Manual Physical Deck Input
        User->>UI: Search & Pick Physical Cards Drawn + Upright/Reversed
    end

    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/readings/sessions (Spread, Cards, Question, Locale)
    API->>DB: Verify Quota / Deduct Crystals (ACID Transaction)
    API->>DB: Load Mystic Profile (Zodiac, Life Path) & Recent Journal Context
    API->>AI: Send Structured Prompt + Guardrails (Stream Request)
    AI-->>API: Stream Synthesis Chunks (SSE)
    API-->>UI: Forward SSE Stream (Energy -> Positions -> Synthesis -> Action)
    UI-->>User: Render Real-time Mystical Reading

    opt Follow-up Q&A (Max 3) or Clarifier Card (Max 2)
        User->>UI: Draw Clarifier Card OR Ask Follow-up Question
        UI->>API: POST /api/v1/readings/sessions/{id}/clarifier (or /chat)
        API->>DB: Deduct Clarifier/Chat Crystals & Append Session Record
        API->>AI: Stream Contextual Clarification
        AI-->>UI: SSE Clarifier Interpretation
    end

    opt Save Journal & Export Shareable Card
        User->>UI: Add Reflection Note & Click "Generate Share Card"
        UI->>API: PUT /journal & POST /share-card (9:16 or 1:1)
        API-->>UI: Return High-Res Shareable Card Image URL
    end
